\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-291u9f78fkg000\">当您订阅的投放账户下，存在智擎版标准项目状态变更时，会为您下发消息通知，通知范围：</p><ol data-id=\"o19a1oojk-3mc8sfqpori000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4uivgccehpg00\">仅限「<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">巨量营销</span>」账户下的<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">智擎版标准项目</span></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3eapabb79k4000\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"></span>当您的项目状态（分一级项目状态、二级项目状态）发生变更时（当前暂不支持部分账号、投放时段相关的状态变更，已支持状态详见下文），均会下发消息通知。<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\"></span></li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3bdmmp0j3c8000\">注意：本事件<u>不包含项目配置变更</u>，智擎版标准项目配置变更请订阅另外一个事件<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/43/docs/1870871057340553?origin=left_nav\" target=\"_blank\">【<span style=\"color: #323335;\">智擎版标准项目配置实时变更</span>】</a><span style=\"color: #323335;\">settings.stdproject.realtime</span></li></ol></div></div></div><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-gkj1kgm0l2o00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-gkj1kgm0l2o00\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-9xhaiv4pkw400\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-8ny557m9lbk00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-8ny557m9lbk00\">关联API接口</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-14rpo89adfxc0\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/std_project/list/</p><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-5imgfl7g0as00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-5imgfl7g0as00\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-a8h6pxo20eo0\">POST</p><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-1tgcx8pxkri80\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-1tgcx8pxkri80\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"header\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1722481732805646\"> 【X-Open-Signature签名校验】</a></section></section></section><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-b0xnkjk8yvs00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-b0xnkjk8yvs00\">请求参数</h1><h2 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cr7wgjug97c00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-cr7wgjug97c00\">基础信息</h2><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"request\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息ID,唯一标识</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅任务ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">service_label</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅服务类型<br>允许值: <code><span style=\"color: #2f54eb;\">status.stdproject.realtime</span></code><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-54rhv9dvgik000\">智擎版标准项目状态实时推送</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-cyi0utgrwi000\">消息实际产生时间，秒级时间戳</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">timestamp</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">毫秒时间戳，本条消息实际推送时间，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">nonce</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随机数，和timestamp组合防重放，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_relation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账号对应关系，包含所有的授权关系</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">core_user_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">用户授权账号</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5hvzj3la7pc000\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bvphx8iap6w00\">投放账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">事件类型 可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-h47krm6zuy800\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-57zecoljn4g00\"><code>ADVERTISER</code> 投放账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">event</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">事件类型 可选值:<br><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-bsiwh7zgi0o00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-e653nvhde1s00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_CHANGE</code> 项目状态变更</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">content</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">project_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-127p0xosu5cg00\">状态发生变更的项目ids</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status_first</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">项目一级状态，可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-5jfvt273wtk00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3x3leada37s00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_DELETE</code> 已删除</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-bab1sm2y1bk00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_DISABLE</code> 未投放</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9iidrmkm05w00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_ENABLE</code> 启用中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9wnxpjzebeg00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_FROZEN</code> 已终止</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">status_second</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">项目二级状态，可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-953n9itzoy000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-hr83kxxqmhk00\"><code>ADVERTISER_AVATAR_OFFLINE</code> 未投放-账户头像不可投</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-djondl5932800\"><code>APP_NOT_AVAILABLE_FOR_DELIVERY</code> 未投放-应用不可投放</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-gps8ptqzzk000\"><code>LACK_BASIC_MATERIAL_STATUS</code> 未投放-素材待补充</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7phywn4m7fg00\"><code>LIVE_ROOM_NOT_AVAILABLE_FOR_DELIVERY</code> 未投放-关联直播间不可投</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5read7m577s00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_AUDIT</code> 未投放-新建审核中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-6gu07pf22o400\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_AWEME_ACCOUNT_DISABLED</code> 未投放-抖音账号不可投放</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-a3bk8mp3tjc00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_BUDGET_EXCEED</code> 未投放-项目超出预算</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-d3fmt9s82q000\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_OFFLINE_AUDIT</code> 未投放-审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4tb3lw0144q000\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_PROCEDURAL_DISABLE</code> 未投放-系统暂停</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4yqcuh7ple8000\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_PRODUCT_OFFLINE</code> 未投放-关联商品不可投</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3d0l0zmqap2000\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_REACH_DAILY_DELIVERY</code> 未投放-已达投放时长</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-35kx8eg8yzg000\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_REAUDIT</code> 未投放-修改审核中</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-27vg1faji36s00\"><code>PROJECT_STATUS_STOP</code> 未投放-手动暂停</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 id=\"h4kgw8yp6-g38u39bdgaw00\" data-id=\"h4kgw8yp6-g38u39bdgaw00\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22subscribe_task_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22service_label%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22publish_time%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22timestamp%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22nonce%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22account_relation%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn